; KERNEL32 by-ordinal flat-thunk / handle helpers imported by TAPI32.
; Names from the Windows Me symbol file (Geoff Chappell). NONAME = by-ordinal import.
; NOTE: ThunkInitLSF@41 is the Microsoft-INTERNAL connect (never in a public SDK); we
;       connect via the public ThunkConnect32 instead -- see the engine docs.
LIBRARY KERNEL32
EXPORTS
    Kernel32_Ord36               @36 NONAME
    Kernel32_Ord43               @43 NONAME
    Kernel32_Ord45               @45 NONAME
    Kernel32_Ord46               @46 NONAME
    FT_PrologPrime               @89 NONAME
    QT_ThunkPrime                @90 NONAME
